K&R  compatibility  extensions, with semantic changes required by
ISO C.  This is the default mode if is not specified.  The prede‐
fined macro __STDC__ has a value of 0 when is invoked in conjunc‐
tion with the option.  Conformance.  Strictly conformant  ISO  C,
without  K&R  C  compatibility  extensions.  The predefined macro
